hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1805","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Muawwizatain key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se kaha gaya aur main ne kaha. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham kehtey hain jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya. (Bukhari: 4977). Quran key fazael ki kitaab."
